---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AffiliateButton from '../components/AffiliateButton.astro';
import PlaceCard from '../components/PlaceCard.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Black Sea Experience | Day Trips & Food in Burgas 2027" 
  description="Explore beyond the Arena. The best day trips, seafood restaurants, and coastal experiences around Burgas during Eurovision."
  breadcrumb="Black Sea Experience"
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <h1 class="text-gradient">The Black Sea Experience</h1>
    <p class="lead">Turn your Eurovision trip into a proper coastal holiday. Discover historic towns, healing mud baths, and top-tier seafood.</p>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="main-column">
        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>📸 Must-See Landmarks in Burgas</h2>
          <p>Before you venture out of the city, make sure you check out the iconic spots right in Burgas that define its coastal charm.</p>
          <ul style="padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 16px;">
            <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>The Sea Garden (Morska Gradina):</strong> The absolute soul of Burgas. A massive, lush park stretching for kilometers along the coast. It's packed with cafes, open-air stages, and will likely be the epicenter of Eurovision side-events.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>The Pier (Mosta):</strong> The iconic T-shaped bridge extending nearly 300 meters into the Black Sea. A sunset walk here is mandatory for any visitor.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong>St. Anastasia Island:</strong> Take a short boat trip from the Port of Burgas to this tiny, volcanic island. It has a fascinating history (it was once a prison!), a lighthouse, and a fantastic little seafood restaurant.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>🏰 Day Trip: Old Nessebar</h2>
          <p>A UNESCO World Heritage site located just 40 minutes north of Burgas. Walk through ancient ruins and dine on the peninsula overlooking the sea.</p>
          <div style="margin-top: 16px;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Book Nessebar Guided Tour" href="https://www.getyourguide.com/s?q=Nessebar" provider="getyourguide" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>🧂 Wellness: Burgas Salt Pans (Pink Lakes)</h2>
          <p>A unique local experience. Float in the hyper-saline pink pools and cover yourself in healing black mud—all just a short bike ride from the Sea Garden.</p>
          <div class="insider-note">
            <strong>Insider Note:</strong> Take the scenic mini-train from the Sea Garden to get there, or rent an e-bike!
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>🍷 Local Gastronomy: Top 3 Seafood Spots</h2>
          <p>Bulgarian coastal cuisine relies heavily on fresh Black Sea fish, mussels, and incredible local wines. We strictly follow the "Rule of 3" — here are the only spots you need to know.</p>
          
          <div class="local-food-guide mt-3 mb-4 p-4" style="background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-cyan);">
            <h3 style="color: var(--accent-cyan); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">🍽️ What to Try in May (Local Burgas Cuisine)</h3>
            <ul style="padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.95rem;">
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Tsatsa (Цаца) with Cold Beer:</strong> The absolute staple of the Bulgarian coast. Small, salty fried sprat fish eaten whole like French fries. You haven't been to Burgas if you haven't eaten Tsatsa on the beach.</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Black Sea Mussels (Черноморски миди):</strong> May is a fantastic season for local mussels. Try them steamed with white wine and garlic, or traditional "Midi s oriz" (mussels with rice).</li>
              <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Ribena Chorba (Рибена чорба):</strong> A rich, traditional fish soup made from freshly caught local fish, often served with a side of spicy garlic vinegar to add to taste.</li>
              <li><strong>Tarator (Таратор):</strong> A refreshing cold soup made of Bulgarian yogurt, cucumbers, garlic, dill, and walnuts. Perfect for warm May afternoons before heading to the EuroClub.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
            <PlaceCard 
              nameEn="Dalyana"
              nameBg="Даляна"
              priceTier="€€"
              highlight="Fresh Black Sea mussels and fried Tsatsa."
              insiderNote="Located right on the fishing port. Very authentic, slightly chaotic, absolutely delicious. Perfect for a sunset beer."
              link="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Dalyana+Burgas"
              linkText="Read Reviews"
              googleMapsUrl="https://www.google.com/maps/search/Dalyana+Burgas"
              instagramUrl="https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/dalyanaburgas/"
            />
            
            <PlaceCard 
              nameEn="Neptun"
              nameBg="Нептун"
              priceTier="€€€"
              highlight="Premium dining with a sea view."
              insiderNote="Located in the Sea Garden. Excellent service and high-end Mediterranean and local cuisine."
              link="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Neptun+Burgas"
              linkText="Read Reviews"
              googleMapsUrl="https://www.google.com/maps/search/Neptun+Burgas"
              instagramUrl="https://www.instagram.com/neptunburgas/"
            />

            <PlaceCard 
              nameEn="Zlatna Ribka"
              nameBg="Златна Рибка"
              priceTier="€€"
              highlight="Classic Bulgarian seafood restaurant."
              insiderNote="A long-time local favorite for traditional fish soup (Ribena chorba) and fried sprat."
              link="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Search?q=Zlatna+Ribka+Burgas"
              linkText="Read Reviews"
              googleMapsUrl="https://www.google.com/maps/search/Zlatna+Ribka+Burgas"
              instagramUrl="https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/zlatnaribka/"
            />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>📅 Book Your Day Trips</h2>
          <p>Don't wait until you arrive. The week of Eurovision will see tens of thousands of extra tourists in Burgas. Book your wine tasting, boat trips, and Nessebar tours in advance.</p>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Explore on GetYourGuide" href="https://www.getyourguide.com/s?q=Burgas" provider="getyourguide" />
            <AffiliateButton text="Explore on Viator" href="https://www.viator.com/searchResults/all?text=Burgas" provider="generic" />
          </div>
          
          <hr style="margin: 24px 0; border-color: var(--glass-border);" />
          
          <h3>Need a Car?</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">The best beaches and authentic villages require driving.</p>
          <AffiliateButton text="Rent a Car" href="https://www.discovercars.com/" provider="discovercars" />
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="glass-panel sticky-box">
          <h3>Book Local Tours</h3>
          <p>Skip the planning. Join guided tours to Nessebar, Sozopol, or wine tasting trips.</p>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
            <AffiliateButton text="Explore on GetYourGuide" href="https://www.getyourguide.com/s?q=Burgas" provider="getyourguide" />
            <AffiliateButton text="Explore on Viator" href="https://www.viator.com/searchResults/all?text=Burgas" provider="generic" />
          </div>
          
          <hr style="margin: 24px 0; border-color: var(--glass-border);" />
          
          <h3>Need a Car?</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">The best beaches and authentic villages require driving.</p>
          <AffiliateButton text="Rent a Car" href="https://www.discovercars.com/" provider="discovercars" />
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .mb-4 {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  h2 {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .insider-note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-amber);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .sticky-box {
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
  }

  .sticky-box h3 {
    color: var(--accent-magenta);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
